# winemac: Move window focus handling to the Cocoa main thread.
# https://gitlab.winehq.org/wine/wine/-/merge_requests/12707 state=merged
# This is the 2nd part of fixing D2R reentrant message hangs on alt-tab usage.

All three events that are removed here are very intertwined logic-wise (even so much so that WINDOW_LOST_FOCUS and APP_DEACTIVATED have to be in one commit together to not cause any regressions).

There are some touch ups here and there (like the extra `WS_VISIBLE` check and fixes to `causing_becomeKeyWindow`) that fix 14 of the user32 msg related test failures.

The win32u change is needed, because the Cocoa main thread owns neither window, but calls `NtUserSetForegroundWindowInternal`, which caused an extra `WM_WINE_SETACTIVEWINDOW` that should not be there.
